	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas tuas, antistes vigilantissime, ad vigesimum sextum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>martii diem scriptas accepi vigesima quinta maii die.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">ex quibus quum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>vestra omnia bono loco esse intelleximus, non mediocriter sumus exhilarati.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Id dumtaxat nobis refricuit dolorem, quod de morte sanctissimi viri <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>d. <persName ref="p8127">Pellicani</persName> et antiquę illius aureę ętatis viri repetis.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Sed hunc nostrum dolorem nonnihil lenivit, quod ei d. <persName ref="p8111">Petrus <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Martyr</persName>, praeceptor meus observandus successerit, cuius acumen, erudi<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tionem et iudicium mirantur omnes ac dolent non plures eum ingenii sui <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>foetus in lucem proferre.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed hanc piam multorum de ipso querimo<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>niam tollet, spero, iam tam quietas et studiis aptas sedes nactus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Scripsi non ita idem ad vos argumenta <persName>Mennonis</persName> de incarnatione <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Christi domini.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Si quę in illa a vobis sunt animadversa, precor, ut primo <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>quoque tempore ad mea ea transcribere non gravemini.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Si mea apologia <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>feliciter succedit, spes est <persName>Mennonis</persName> regnum, quod latissime in hisce <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>omnibus maritimis regionibus patet, ab extremis <placeName ref="l640">Flandrię</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>oris <placeName>Dantiscum</placeName> usque, imminutum iri.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Vocatus iam sum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>franckfort colloquii caussa, quod privatim inter <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>pastores Germanicos francfordenses et peregrinos de coena <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>dominica institui deberet; sed ęgre hinc possum divelli <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>cum propter apologiam <persName>Mennonis</persName> tum etiam propter aliam quandam, quam <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>adversus <persName ref="p7024">Wesphalum</persName> meditor propter ipsius mendacia, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quibus non modo me privatim, sed omnes ecclesias <placeName ref="l642">Phrysicas</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>iniustissime accusavit et apud universum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>mundum traduxit.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Prodibit, spero, hęc apologia ad proximas <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><placeName ref="l157">Francfordianas</placeName> nundinas, si non <placeName ref="l157">Francfordiam</placeName> profectio scriptionem <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>meam impediat.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Inter alia confutare statuimus illud <persName>Marcii</persName> / <persName>Martini</persName>?</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Fabri commentum de intermissa apud nordanos totius institutionis <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>recitatione, quemadmodum id nobis impingit in libro <placeName ref="l749">Saxonicę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>confessionis, quem a vobis visum et lectum esse non dubito.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Est adolescens optimę spei, cui has meas literas ad te perferendas <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>tradidi, qui si <placeName ref="l491">Argentinę</placeName> studii causa hęrebit, has ad te suis inclusas <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>transmittet; quem precor ut, ubi <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> venerit, tuo iuvare consilio non <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>graveris.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Speramus eum ecclesię dei adhuc utilem fore ministru<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>m apud nostrates.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Raptim admodum <placeName ref="l351">Nordę</placeName> 15<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>57.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Iunii 5. Omnes meos praeceptores observandissimos d. <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandrum</persName>, d. <lb xml:id="p1z36"/><persName ref="p8111">Petrum Martyrem</persName>, d. <lb xml:id="p1z37"/><persName ref="p1283">Gesnerum</persName> salutes precor.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">[Non] esset inconsultum <persName>doctorem Albertum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z38"/><placeName ref="l61">Bremensem</placeName> ad constantiam hortari.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8415">Martinus Micronius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Adhuc obsidetur comes <persName>Reydberganus</persName>, sed brevi cogetur prae inopia fru<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>menti sese hostibus dedere, <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>ut speramus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Ecclesia nostra iam (deo sit gratia) e<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>st bono et tranquillo loco.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Eruditissimo ac vigilantissimo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> antistiti d. <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName>, d. ac fratri <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>suo plurimum in Christo observando.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
